    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "scale of paths to heal... i don't know. it feels less like a path and more like a cliff. i've been a caregiver for so long that \"me\" doesn't even exist anymore. there is no \"healing\" a void that big. it's just... empty. like i'm just a shell waiting to be discarded. i don't see why i should bother trying to find a new version of myself when this version is just broken.",
