      "content": "but what if there isn't a way forward? what if the \"way forward\" is just more of this? just more years of pretending to be a person while feeling like a ghost? it feels like i've already finished my part. like i've done all the living i was meant to do, and now i'm just... leftover. it feels more honest to just admit that the light is gone and stop trying to find it in the dark.",
